  "href": "extensive_game/extensive_game_behavioral_equilibrium.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Behavioral Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>Let $\\Gamma$ be a finite extensive form game with perfect recall. A mixed\nequilibrium of $\\Gamma$ is a Nash equilibrium of its mixed normal-form extension.\nA behavioral equilibrium of $\\Gamma$ is a Nash equilibrium of the compact\ncontinuous game whose strategy sets are behavioral strategy spaces $B_i$ and whose\npayoffs are expected payoffs in $\\Gamma$.</p>",
